WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.623
Unit eighteen. Simple Directions!

2
00:00:04.574 --> 00:00:11.868
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:16.552
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.602 --> 00:00:20.755
Today we learn: Simple Directions. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.795 --> 00:00:25.145
Left. Say it with me. Left!

6
00:00:28.684 --> 00:00:32.051
Right. Say it with me. Right!

7
00:00:35.514 --> 00:00:39.097
Straight. Say it with me. Straight!

8
00:00:42.581 --> 00:00:46.014
Turn. Say it with me. Turn!

9
00:00:49.514 --> 00:00:53.247
Near. Say it with me. Near!

10
00:00:56.747 --> 00:01:00.097
Far. Say it with me. Far!

11
00:01:03.614 --> 00:01:07.064
Corner. Say it with me. Corner!

12
00:01:10.546 --> 00:01:14.246
Street. Say it with me. Street!

13
00:01:17.748 --> 00:01:29.027
Grammar time! Imperatives for directions. Listen. Turn left. Go straight. Turn right at the corner.

14
00:01:29.077 --> 00:01:36.269
Your turn. Say it with me. Turn left. Go straight. Turn right at the corner.

15
00:01:41.147 --> 00:01:48.495
To find the shop, go straight, then turn left at the corner. It is near the street, not far from here.

16
00:01:48.545 --> 00:01:50.068
I like this story!

17
00:01:51.096 --> 00:01:56.391
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.441 --> 00:01:57.591
Straight!

19
00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:03.699
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:04.899
Corner!

21
00:02:05.933 --> 00:02:13.749
Think and answer. How do you get from your house to school?

22
00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:14.949
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:18.697
This unit's value is Helpfulness.

24
00:02:18.747 --> 00:02:21.255
I can show helpfulness every day!

25
00:02:22.245 --> 00:02:26.691
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:26.741 --> 00:02:28.314
Goodbye, everyone!

